          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate,\n\u00a0\n</li>\n<li>\nThe slaves report the death of F\u0101\u1e0dila [ ]\n\u00a0\n</li>\n<li>\nthe Jew, on Wednesday, the twenty-eighth [ in the year]\n\u00a0\n</li>\n<li>\nsix-hundred and twenty-[ ] and she left her aforementioned son [ ]\n\u00a0\n</li>\n<li>\nhe is called Ab\u016b D\u0101\u02be\u016bd, mentioned herein .. [ on]\n\u00a0\n</li>\n<li>\nthe aforementioned date. Praise be to God, the eternal.\n\u00a0\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
